1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,980
When your cat sticks its butt in your face,

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,110
it's being polite.

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,270
A tail straight up means hello.

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:07,230
When two friendly cats meet,

5
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:11,010
they touch noses, then circle around and sniff each other's rear.

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:14,880
Glands back there give off a scent that works like an ID card,

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,290
unique to each cat.

8
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:19,110
Lifting the tail is holding out the ID.

9
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:20,860
Kittens do it for their mother,

10
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,450
too.

11
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,120
When your cat turns around and shows you its butt,

12
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,690
it's greeting you like family.

13
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:28,080
You're just not expected to sniff back.

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,800
So next time it happens, don't take it personally,

15
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,133
because
